&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As AvePoint continues its journey from US$500M to US$1B+ in revenue,&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;growth&amp;nbsp;can only be fuelled by&amp;nbsp;the best talent in the ANZ market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
