&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;312 6 - Network Connection Director – Unilever - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Network Connection Director plays a pivotal role in driving operational excellence across the Unilever account, ensuring teams are connected, aligned, and operating at maximum effectiveness to deliver exceptional client and business outcomes. Responsible for&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;analysing&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;optimising&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;processes&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;across&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;complex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;global&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;network,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;role&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;identifies&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;opportunities&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;streamline&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;workflows,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;improve&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;utilisation,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;enhance&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;collaboration,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4