Company Name: Berries And Oak Limited
Company Address:Aiken's Village, Dublin 18

Work Address: Unit 33/34, Nutgrove Shopping Centre, Nutgrove Way, Rathfarnham, Dublin 14, D14 T867

Job Description:

Berries And Oak Limited is seeking a General and Operations Manager responsible for the overall management of the company, defining and implementing strategies, managing resources and monitoring business performance.

Main Duties:

Define and implement the company’s strategies, objectives and management processes;
